      <div class="view-content">
        <h3>A.A. 2026/2027</h3>
    <div class="views-row"><div class="views-field views-field-title-1"><span class="field-content"><a href="/it/corsi/altre_offerte/aa-2026/2027/lettere-moderne-classe-lm-14-immatricolati-nellaa-2026-2027" hreflang="it">Lettere moderne (Classe LM-14)-immatricolati nell&#039;a.a. 2026-2027</a> [CBBof2 2027]</span></div></div>
